    "aboutPage": {
      "lede": "I plan the campaign, cut the film, and build the thing it lands on.",
      "statement": "Marketing, creative and digital - usually all three on the same brief. Based in Dubai.",
      "paragraphs": [
        "I started in edit suites and IT rooms, which turns out to be a useful pair of habits. One taught me that an idea only counts once it is actually finished; the other taught me that most things break at the join, not in the middle.",
        "These days that means I can sit in the strategy conversation, direct the shoot, do the edit, and then build the landing page and the automation behind it. Not because I want to do everything - because a lot of good work dies in the handover between people who each only do one part of it.",
        "I like briefs with a real constraint in them: a deadline, a budget, a channel that behaves badly. Constraints make decisions fast. I would rather ship something specific and sharp this month than something perfect and theoretical next quarter.",
        "Work has taken me from Syria to the UAE, from freelance edits to founding a small agency to running marketing in-house. The through-line has not changed: figure out what is worth saying, make it properly, and put it somewhere it can work."
      ],
